---

<section class="cta-section section" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div class="cta-content">
      <h2 id="cta-heading" class="cta-title">Un besoin Angular ? Parlons de votre projet.</h2>
      <p class="cta-subtitle">20 minutes pour cadrer votre besoin : mission, audit ou renfort Lead Tech.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/rdv" class="btn btn-primary cta-btn">
          Réserver un échange de 20 min
        </a>
        <p class="cta-mention">En visio · 20 min · sans engagement</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a6e 0%, #2d6cdf 100%);
    padding-block: 5rem;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .cta-subtitle {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-btn {
    background-color: #fff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .cta-btn:hover {
    background-color: #f0eade;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .cta-mention {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
</style>
